        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    dividend_year_1 = 0.5\n    dividend_year_2 = 0.5\n    growth_rate = 0.06\n    required_rate_of_return = 0.10\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    dividend_year_3 = dividend_year_2 * (1 + growth_rate)\n    terminal_value_year_2 = dividend_year_3 / (required_rate_of_return - growth_rate)\n\n    present_value_year_1 = dividend_year_1 / (1 + required_rate_of_return)\n    present_value_year_2 = dividend_year_2 / (1 + required_rate_of_return) ** 2\n    present_value_terminal_value = terminal_value_year_2 / (1 + required_rate_of_return) ** 2\n\n    equity_value = (\n        present_value_year_1\n        + present_value_year_2\n        + present_value_terminal_value\n    )\n\n    # Return answer\n    return round(equity_value, 3)\n```",
